Bundled third-party code
========================

src/vendor/pdfio/
-----------------

This directory vendors the library sources of pdfio, version 1.6.5, from
https://github.com/michaelrsweet/pdfio, including its ttf library (ttf.c,
ttf.h), which ships in the same release. The release, the commit it
resolves to, the tarball checksum, the import date and the local patches
are recorded in src/vendor/PROVENANCE.

  Copyright (c) 2021-2026 by Michael R Sweet.
  ttf.c, ttf.h: Copyright (c) 2018-2025 by Michael R Sweet.

Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0, with the optional
exceptions reproduced below. The full licence text is preserved at
src/vendor/pdfio/LICENSE and the notice at src/vendor/pdfio/NOTICE. Files
changed by the local patches carry a notice saying so.

src/zpd_glyphs.h
----------------

The glyph-name to Unicode table and the MacRoman encoding table in this
file are taken from pdfio's examples/pdf2text.c (pdfio 1.6.5), Copyright
(c) 2022-2025 by Michael R Sweet, under the same Apache License, Version
2.0, with pdfio's exceptions. The table follows the Adobe Glyph List. The
file was reorganised for zupdf (sorted for binary search, duplicates
dropped) and carries a notice saying so.

